== API function changes ==
* {{api|AcceptProposal}}() now requires a hardware event
* {{api|GetLFGBootProposal}}() now returns an additional ''reason'' value.
* {{api|UninviteUnit}}("name" [, "reason"]) added reason argument for LFD kick votes.

